FHIR-MLM
The code uses the FHIR-MLM tokenizer, data collator, and model code written by Trevor Yu (University
of Waterloo). They are not included in this repository.

fhirclient
The code depends on fhirclient 4.1.0 from SMART on FHIR (Copyright 2015 Boston Children's Hospital),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. At run time, common/fhirclient_patch.py
changes one element definition in the installed package, so that
MedicationRequest.medicationCodeableConcept accepts a list, as MIMIC-IV on FHIR writes it.

MIMIC-IV
The code processes MIMIC-IV and MIMIC-IV on FHIR, which are distributed by PhysioNet under the
PhysioNet Credentialed Health Data License. No MIMIC-IV data is included.
